WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.470
A jewel case opens on a table.

2
00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.280
A woman lifts out a diamond necklace.

3
00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.740
It isn't hers.

4
00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:09.830
At the ball, she is the star of the night.

5
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.780
Then, at home, her neck is bare.

6
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:14.650
The necklace is gone.

7
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.190
Ten years follow.

8
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:20.590
The debts pile up, and the same woman
is washing the floor with great swishes

9
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.790
of water.

10
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.600
One borrowed necklace.

11
00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:24.950
Ten years.

12
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.100
So who is really to blame?

13
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:32.040
In this mission, you'll follow the plot,
from the invitation to the last repayment.

14
00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:35.380
You'll meet Mathilde's
dreams: "She had no dresses,

15
00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.370
no jewels, nothing."

16
00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.820
And you'll put each
suspect on trial: Mathilde,

17
00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:43.750
her husband Loisel, Madame Forestier.

18
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.770
Or just bad luck?

19
00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:48.920
Your mission: decide
who is really to blame.
